#31300
The Rabbit Hole~
This area (31301-31399) was created as a place for lower level 
characters to gain some exp on their own as well as learn some basic MUD 
commands.  
And to help those mid-level players that must share elvens and gnolls, with high levels who need to keep alignment.
~
313 0 0 0 0 0
S
#31301
Entrance to the Rabbit Hole~
    You are standing next to the giant rabbit hole.  It's quite a large 
hill...the rabbits that live inside must be REALLY big.  The hillside 
slopes to the north, east, west and south.  There is a large hole going down
into the dirt...I bet that's where the rabbits are.
~
